{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義熙六年先逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉言覺明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語分衛，晉言乞食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉云覺賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今天衣寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當是五日為一會耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今嚴州是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今淨慈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐大歷中，法照師於衡州開五會念\n佛。今李知遙為五會，應是師法於法照。五會者，當是五日為一會也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "荊王楫，徽宗之子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天童即其識神。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五貫也"}
